So the solution is to make sure Excalibur lands in the first slot in
the carried objects list. Archons are generated with only a weapon in
their inventory, and will wield it immediately. Therefore, you
immediately take its weapon away, give it Excalibur, and wait for it
to wield it. This way, the first slot in the list is permanently
occupied. Only then you give it the remaining armor, amulet of
reflection/life saving, unicorn horn, and potions of gain level.

